{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/396433-share-your-pc-s-art-pictures-photos-cosplay","id":396433,"title":"Share your PC's, Art, Pictures, Photos, Cosplay!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-07T09:57:58-08:00","id":396433,"title":"Share your PC's, Art, Pictures, Photos, Cosplay!","content":"yeah. so the idea is to post any art related to one of your signature characters, either be an ilustration or a picture or even a cosplay if you Larp or if you wanna do it for the kick of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T12:31:36-08:00","id":396629,"title":"","content":"Partly to see if it works, partly to show off a character, this is a (really old) image of a vampire in my troupe's chronicle. Her name is Victoria Bettis, but she never goes by that name. I drew her figure in ink on Bristol board, and the background is terrible digital... I still like the image despite how much I hate in it.<br /> <img src=\"https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/elfwood--artwork/758e8f10-2600-11e4-9924-dd4623224164/elysian-gate.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T19:39:41-08:00","id":397080,"title":"","content":"Well I'm lucky enough that one of my players is a <a href=\"http://clone-artist.deviantart.com\" target=\"_blank\">pretty damn good artist</a>, and he does all sorts of illustrations for our games. Here's a sampling of his Werewolf works, but there is also a pile of stuff for Changeling. The Lost, Planescape, Exalted, Cthulhu Mythos, Dotor Who and all sorts of other stuff.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fc08.deviantart.net/fs70/f/2013/026/a/0/genes_at_project_deepwater_by_clone_artist-d5su8e5.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://fc01.deviantart.net/fs70/i/2012/310/0/1/bleeds_night_by_clone_artist-d5k7ib4.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://th07.deviantart.net/fs70/PRE/i/2012/114/3/1/grey_hunter_by_clone_artist-d4xghiw.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://th07.deviantart.net/fs70/PRE/i/2012/178/7/d/buries_the_dead___crinos_by_clone_artist-d553pts.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T01:16:24-08:00","id":406499,"title":"","content":"I recently started feeling nostalgic for the VtM campaigns I played in back in the mid 90s, so I updated my two main characters to V20 format for Clanbook-style character sheets. Drawing the new art for them yesterday got me jonesing to play again, which is problematic in that my gaming circle scattered to the four winds back before the turn of the millenium. Here's a look-see.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/bruinsfan/1456542/10305/10305_original.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Clementine Hapsburg</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/bruinsfan/1456542/10715/10715_original.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Carlton Ionescu</a> (I warn you, this character was originally based on the most groan-worthy clich\u00e9 I could think of, although I played him seriously and had lots of fun)<br /> <br /> For some reason jpg images are not uploading correctly for me, so I'm posting links instead. Sorry for the extra step.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-15T09:18:35-08:00","id":406754,"title":"","content":"These pics are over 10 years old so please bear with me.<br /> <br /> Babs Sterling (Son of Ether): <a href=\"http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantart.com/art/Babs-Daughter-of-Ether-3870192\" target=\"_blank\">http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantar...-Ether-3870192</a><br /> Randi Bowman (Hollow One): <a href=\"http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantart.com/art/Christmas-Capers-4218859\" target=\"_blank\">http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantar...Capers-4218859</a><br /> Blane Rudnick (Tremere): <a href=\"http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantart.com/art/Dedicated-to-KesaiSerris-25681189\" target=\"_blank\">http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantar...erris-25681189</a><br /> <br /> Some signature characters from my homebrew game... (These are also very old.)<br /> <br /> Judith Werner: <a href=\"http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantart.com/art/EDIT-Judith-of-the-Oracles-45640921\" target=\"_blank\">http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantar...acles-45640921</a><br /> Clayton Hill: <a href=\"http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantart.com/art/Heritagebook-Nymphs-11911521\" target=\"_blank\">http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantar...ymphs-11911521</a><br /> Natsume Tokemo: <a href=\"http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantart.com/art/EDIT-Heritagebook-Shepherds-10067635\" target=\"_blank\">http://yaoi-huntress-earth.deviantar...herds-10067635</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T11:42:21-08:00","id":423150,"title":"","content":"Here are the character portraits for the cabal in my current Mage game. These are all by my buddy Aernout - find his Deviant Art page <a href=\"http://lepidact.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. The pics are slightly smaller than the originals, but you should be able to make out the cool details he added.<br /> <br /> First up is Alastair. He's a Euthanatos shadow operative. He uses sensory deprivation as one of his main foci - you can see his blacked-out goggles and earplugs for listening to white noise in the pic:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i223.photobucket.com/albums/dd302/Kamelion69/01%20alastair_zpsorznwsap.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Next up is Gideon. He's a rather paranoid Son of Ether, who often uses a mobile hologram to interact with the world (that's him at the back, projecting the hologram through some weird science stuff). Gideon has a permanent Paradox Flaw from messing with Time too much - any woven fabric he touches unravels. That's why he's wearing all that kinky leather:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i223.photobucket.com/albums/dd302/Kamelion69/02%20Giddy_zpsyeysnjr1.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Next we have Kailani. She's a Dreamspeaker who isn't afraid to shoot you in the face if you cross her. Her avatar is a many-armed dancing goddess - you might be able to make it out on her t-shirt:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i223.photobucket.com/albums/dd302/Kamelion69/03%20Kailani_zpsyocshcgw.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T11:42:57-08:00","id":423151,"title":"","content":"Rodney is next. Rodney is a Cultist of Ecstasy with the Fae Blood Merit. That's why he's carrying around a freaking huge chimerical broadsword. Any resemblance to Black Razor or Stormbringer is entirely coincidental:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i223.photobucket.com/albums/dd302/Kamelion69/04%20Rodney_zpsh75kej2v.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Finally we have Selene. She's a young teenager with more Arete than she knows what to do with. She also likes dancing:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i223.photobucket.com/albums/dd302/Kamelion69/05%20Selene_zpsfuug5mq7.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T17:56:22-08:00","id":423636,"title":"","content":"Those are great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T02:47:44-08:00","id":423930,"title":"","content":"Yeah, he has a real talent <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. He's always been a great artist but he recently finished studying at Gnomon, so he has some major chops now <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. We're really lucky to have someone like that in our group!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2543-thebian","name":"Thebian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2543_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T13:47:52-08:00","id":424443,"title":"","content":"i had a cosplay of my Werecoyote somewhere xD. does anyone has larped as one of your chars?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T23:38:43-07:00","id":467052,"title":"","content":"Here are some illustrations I've done this week of notable figures from Prohibition Era New York who would fit into my main character's backstory.<br /> <br /> (1) J.P. Morgan Jr., a banking tycoon (tries and fails to head off the stock market crash in 1929)<br /> <img src=\"http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/bruinsfan/1456542/12175/12175_900.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (2) Deputy Chief Inspector Edward Mulrooney (he becomes the NYPD Commissioner in 1930)<br /> <img src=\"http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/bruinsfan/1456542/12422/12422_900.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (3) Stephanie St. Clair, the Numbers Queen of Harlem<br /> <img src=\"http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/bruinsfan/1456542/12639/12639_900.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (4) Raymond M Hood, celebrated architect who designed Tribune Tower in Chicago, the New York Daily News Building, the American Radiator Building, and worked on Rockefeller Center<br /> <img src=\"http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/bruinsfan/1456542/12986/12986_900.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"us